   "summary": "Transparent Tribe is reportedly deploying a new malware cluster, including the custom backdoor PATCHCORD and the Go-based SHEETCORD implant that uses Google Sheets for command-and-control, against Afghan telecommunications providers and South Asian critical infrastructure organizations. The campaign uses sector-specific lures such as fake VPN installers impersonating Afghan Telecom and domains mimicking India's National Informatics Centre to deliver additional payloads like HACKERAI C2 Agent, SHEETCREEP, ValleyRAT, and GateSentinel. Targeted sectors span telecommunications, government, defense, energy, and healthcare, though no specific victim entities are named in the reporting."
